# CR 601.2f: increases come first, then what directly affects the total. Sphere of Resistance ("spells cost {1} more")
# makes Lightning Bolt {1}{R}, less than three, so Trinisphere makes it three - not four, as it would be were the minimum
# applied before Sphere's increase. Bot1 casts three Moxen, Sphere with two of them, Black Lotus for {1} (Sphere) with the
# third, and Trinisphere for {4} (Sphere) with the Lotus's three red and a Mountain. On turn 3 it floats four red and casts
# the Bolt: one red is left.

